"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8fbeed60-0bea-36a4-b4e7-cf0825125816","knowledge_id":96,"title":"思考过程","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":96,"title":"思考过程","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7f2043da-c0df-382d-a26b-d336b42ef55e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"当在字典中使用 `for`循环时会得到键值对的**键**。使用这个键，可以得到**键**所对应的**值**。\n\n让我们看看实现这个方法所需的步骤：\n\n- 循环遍历字典中的每一个键。\n- 将该键所对应的值增加**1**。\n- 最后，打印更新后的字典。","text_html":"<p>当在字典中使用 <code>for</code>循环时会得到键值对的<strong>键</strong>。使用这个键，可以得到<strong>键</strong>所对应的<strong>值</strong>。</p>\n<p>让我们看看实现这个方法所需的步骤：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>循环遍历字典中的每一个键。</li>\n<li>将该键所对应的值增加<strong>1</strong>。</li>\n<li>最后，打印更新后的字典。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"ChallengeRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7952330d-7a08-3f68-b816-0987d50e36cc","title":"字典值增加","challenge_id":773,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"challenge_id":773,"title":"字典值增加","difficulty":"Easy","points":10,"success_ratio":"76.3%","problem_statement_md":"编写一个Python程序，将字典的值增加**1**。","problem_statement_en_md":"## Problem Description\n\nCreate a Python program to increment the values of a dictionary by **1**.\n\n### Example\n\n**input**\n```text\nfor a dictionary {'Cody': 50, 'Jack': 57, 'Seth': 59, 'Roman': 67}\n```\n\n**output**\n```text\n{'Cody': 51, 'Jack': 58, 'Seth': 60, 'Roman': 68}\n```","input_format_md":"","output_format_md":"","constraints_md":"","hint_md":"","code_templates":[{"id":2013,"language":"python3","template":"# 用你的代码替换 ___\n\n# 定义函数incrementer，使每个玩家的分数增加1\ndef incrementer(dictionary):\n\n    # for循环遍历字典\n    # 并将分数增加1\n    for ___:\n        ___\n\n    # 打印更新后的字典\n    print(___)\n\n\n# 定义字典\nplayer_scores = eval(input())\n\n# 调用函数\nincrementer(___)","template_head":"","template_tail":"","solution_code":"# 定义函数incrementer，使每个玩家的分数增加1\ndef incrementer(dictionary):\n\n    # for循环遍历字典\n    # 并将分数增加1\n    for key in dictionary:\n        dictionary[key] += 1\n\n    # 打印更新后的字典\n    print(dictionary)\n\n\n# 定义字典\nplayer_scores = eval(input())\n\n# 调用函数\nincrementer(player_scores)","prepend_code":"","append_code":"","file_name":"","judge_mode":"testcase","unittest_codes":[],"additional_files":[]}],"testcases":[{"id":2162,"case_no":1,"stdin":"{'Cody': 50, 'Jack': 57, 'Seth': 59, 'Roman': 67}","expected_output":"{'Cody': 51, 'Jack': 58, 'Seth': 60, 'Roman': 68}\n","explanation":"","sample":true,"additional":false}],"user_data":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1447"}
